{
    "title": "Drive Smarter",
    "description": "NOW AVAILABLE ON ANDROID AUTO!\r\n\r\nDrive Smarter enhances your driving experience when you are using select* connected Cobra and Escort devices.\r\n\r\nDrive Smarter lets you use your smartphone as a companion to your DashCam. \r\n\r\nA streamlined onboarding process lets you quickly connect your Dash Cam and configure it as part of your dashboard. You can \"add\" a virtual vehicle to your account, then add compatible* Cobra and Escort branded devices to your vehicle. \r\n\r\nUsers with mobile WiFi hotspots** can optionally connect their cameras directly to the Drive Smarter cloud, to avail of instant upload of videos and to share time-sensitive data and event information.\r\n\r\nView recordings stored on your Dash Camera SD card; recordings are conveniently sorted by timeline which highlights events of importance; such as possible collisions or impact. Select files to download to your phone; trim video clips and share with your contacts using your favorite communications app.\r\n\r\nTake advantage of streamlined reports generated for insurance claims processing.\r\n\r\nGet help using the in-built Mayday services that are automatically triggered in severe collisions - send details regarding your current situation to a designed in-case-of-emergency contact.\r\n\r\nKeep your devices' firmware up-to-date so you are enjoying all the latest features that your devices' have to offer.\r\n\r\nEmergency videos stored in the Drive Smarter cloud. ***\r\n\r\nConvenient Snapshot button lets you remotely take photos via connected cameras, with a tap on your smartphone screen.\r\n\r\ncurrently the Drive Smarter app and service is compatible with the Cobra SC- series Dash Cameras. Check out drivesmarter.com for up-to-date information.\r\n\r\n* should have upload / download speeds equal to or exceeding 4G / Cat 4 speeds\r\n\r\n** See drivesmarter.com for latest storage / deletion policies for free user accounts on the Drive Smarter cloud.",
    "descriptionHTML": "NOW AVAILABLE ON ANDROID AUTO!<br><br>Drive Smarter enhances your driving experience when you are using select* connected Cobra and Escort devices.<br><br>Drive Smarter lets you use your smartphone as a companion to your DashCam. <br><br>A streamlined onboarding process lets you quickly connect your Dash Cam and configure it as part of your dashboard. You can &quot;add&quot; a virtual vehicle to your account, then add compatible* Cobra and Escort branded devices to your vehicle. <br><br>Users with mobile WiFi hotspots** can optionally connect their cameras directly to the Drive Smarter cloud, to avail of instant upload of videos and to share time-sensitive data and event information.<br><br>View recordings stored on your Dash Camera SD card; recordings are conveniently sorted by timeline which highlights events of importance; such as possible collisions or impact. Select files to download to your phone; trim video clips and share with your contacts using your favorite communications app.<br><br>Take advantage of streamlined reports generated for insurance claims processing.<br><br>Get help using the in-built Mayday services that are automatically triggered in severe collisions - send details regarding your current situation to a designed in-case-of-emergency contact.<br><br>Keep your devices&#39; firmware up-to-date so you are enjoying all the latest features that your devices&#39; have to offer.<br><br>Emergency videos stored in the Drive Smarter cloud. ***<br><br>Convenient Snapshot button lets you remotely take photos via connected cameras, with a tap on your smartphone screen.<br><br>currently the Drive Smarter app and service is compatible with the Cobra SC- series Dash Cameras. Check out drivesmarter.com for up-to-date information.<br><br>* should have upload / download speeds equal to or exceeding 4G / Cat 4 speeds<br><br>** See drivesmarter.com for latest storage / deletion policies for free user accounts on the Drive Smarter cloud.",
